From 5a3420244422cd1757ca71eeff6014cabf4e3142 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: n64recomp-cross <n64recomp-cross@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:28:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] S2DEX: implement object commands (OBJ_RECTANGLE/_R,
 OBJ_SPRITE, OBJ_MOVEMEM, SELECT_DL, GENSTAT, LDTX_*) and BG divide-by-zero
 guards

Clean-room implementation from the public N64 SDK S2DEX documentation and
gs2dex.h structure definitions. Pure math lives in src/gbi/rt64_s2dex_obj.*
so it can be unit tested offline.
---
 CMakeLists.txt              |   1 +
 src/gbi/rt64_gbi_s2dex.cpp  | 159 ++++++++++++++---
 src/gbi/rt64_gbi_s2dex.h    |  15 +-
 src/gbi/rt64_gbi_s2dex2.cpp |  27 +--
 src/gbi/rt64_gbi_s2dex2.h   |   4 +
 src/gbi/rt64_s2dex_obj.cpp  | 337 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/gbi/rt64_s2dex_obj.h    | 147 ++++++++++++++++
 src/hle/rt64_rsp.h          |   5 +
 8 files changed, 661 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/gbi/rt64_s2dex_obj.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/gbi/rt64_s2dex_obj.h

